{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40074","headline":"尚书命题瓦砚 · 徐夤","name":"尚书命题瓦砚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远向端溪得，皆因郢匠成。\n凿山青霭断，琢石紫花轻。\n散墨松香起，濡毫藻句清。\n入台知价重，着匣恐尘生。\n守黑还全器，临池早着名。\n春闱携就处，军幕载将行。\n不独雄文阵，兼能助笔耕。\n莫嫌涓滴润，深染古今情。\n洗处无瑕玷，添时识满盈。\n兰亭如见用，敲戛有金声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40074.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40074","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}